@startuml
title Alarm Clock State Machine

[*] --> Off

state Activated
Activated : entry / Set alarm time
Activated : do / Ringing alarm
Activated : exit / Stop alarm

state Ringing
Ringing : entry / Current time matches set alarm time
Ringing : do / Ringing alarm
Ringing : exit / Stop alarm

Off --> Activated : set alarm time

Activated --> Ringing : current time matches set alarm time

Ringing --> Activated : stop alarm

ActivatedRoute --> Off : next scheduled alarm time

@enduml
